Here's what needs attention<%= " on your aircraft" if @items.any? %>.
<% @items.each do |aircraft, issues, alerts| %>

<%= aircraft.tail_number %> (<%= aircraft.airworthiness.label %>): <%= aircraft_url(aircraft) %>
<% issues.each do |issue| %>
- <%= { "RED" => "Overdue", "LIMITED" => "Overdue", "ORANGE" => "Due soon", "INFO" => "Deferred" }[issue.severity] %>: <%= issue.title %>. <%= issue.description %>
<% end %>
<% if alerts.any? %>
- New ADs that may apply: <%= alerts.map { _1.ad_number || _1.fr_document_number }.to_sentence %>. Review: <%= aircraft_airworthiness_directives_url(aircraft, anchor: "new-ads") %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% if @certificates.any? %>

Your certificates:
<% @certificates.each do |c| %>
- <%= c.expired? ? "Expired" : "Expires" %> <%= c.expires_on %>: <%= c.kind_label %> <%= c.number %>
<% end %>
<% end %>
<% if @audit_due %>

Records audit due <%= @audit_due %>: <%= new_admin_audit_url %>
<% end %>

Based on the records in Simple Aircraft Manager. Turn these emails off on your profile: <%= edit_profile_url %>
